#: kiconedit.cpp:253
#, kde-format
msgid "New &Window"
msgstr "&Tetingkap Baru"

#: kiconedit.cpp:256
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"New window\n"
"\n"
"Opens a new icon editor window."
msgstr ""
"Tetingkap Baru\n"
"\n"
"Membuka tetingkap editor ikon baru."

#: kiconedit.cpp:259
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"New\n"
"\n"
"Create a new icon, either from a template or by specifying the size"
msgstr ""
"Baru\n"
"\n"
"Cipta ikon baru, sama ada dari templat atau dengan menetapkan saiz"

#: kiconedit.cpp:263
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Open\n"
"\n"
"Open an existing icon"
msgstr ""
"Buka\n"
"\n"
"Buka ikon yang wujud"

#: kiconedit.cpp:271
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Save\n"
"\n"
"Save the current icon"
msgstr ""
"Simpan\n"
"\n"
"Simpan ikon semasa"

#: kiconedit.cpp:276
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Print\n"
"\n"
"Opens a print dialog to let you print the current icon."
msgstr ""
"Cetak\n"
"\n"
"Membuka dialog cetak untuk membenarkan anda mencetak ikon semasa."

#: kiconedit.cpp:284
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Cut\n"
"\n"
"Cut the current selection out of the icon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"Potong\n"
"\n"
"Potong pilihan semasa dari ikon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Anda boleh buat kedua-dua pilihan segi empat tepat dan bulatan)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:288
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Copy\n"
"\n"
"Copy the current selection out of the icon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"Salin\n"
"\n"
"Salin pilihan semasa dari ikon.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Anda boleh buat kedua-dua pilihan segi empat tepat dan pusingan)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:292
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Paste\n"
"\n"
"Paste the contents of the clipboard into the current icon.\n"
"\n"
"If the contents are larger than the current icon you can paste them in a new "
"window.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Select \"Paste transparent pixels\" in the configuration dialog if you "
"also want to paste transparency.)"
msgstr ""
"Tampal\n"
"\n"
"Tampal kandungan klipbod ke dalam ikon semasa.\n"
"\n"
"Jika kandungan lebih besar daripada ikon semasa anda boleh tampalkannya "
"dalam tetingkap baru.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Pilih\"Tampal piksel lutsinar\" dalam dialog tetapan jika anda juga "
"mahu tampal lutsinar.)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:300
#, kde-format
msgid "Paste as &New"
msgstr "Tampal sebagai &Baru"

#: kiconedit.cpp:309
#, kde-format
msgid "Resi&ze..."
msgstr "Saiz&semula..."

#: kiconedit.cpp:312
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Resize\n"
"\n"
"Smoothly resizes the icon while trying to preserve the contents"
msgstr ""
"Saiz semula\n"
"\n"
"Saiz semula ikon semasa dengan licin sambil cuba mengekalkan kandungan"

#: kiconedit.cpp:317
#, kde-format
msgid "&GrayScale"
msgstr "&Skala kelabu"

#: kiconedit.cpp:320
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Gray scale\n"
"\n"
"Gray scale the current icon.\n"
"(Warning: The result is likely to contain colors not in the icon palette"
msgstr ""
"Skala kelabu\n"
"\n"
"Skala kelabu ikon semasa.\n"
"(Amaran: Hasilnya mungkin mengandungi warna yang bukan dalam ikon palet"

#: kiconedit.cpp:327
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Zoom in\n"
"\n"
"Zoom in by one."
msgstr ""
"Zum dalam\n"
"\n"
"Zum dalam sebanyak satu."

#: kiconedit.cpp:331
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Zoom out\n"
"\n"
"Zoom out by one."
msgstr ""
"Zum keluar\n"
"\n"
"Zum keluar sebanyak satu."

