"\n"
"Mentoggel grid dalam grid edit ikon buka/tutup"

#: kiconedit.cpp:388
#, kde-format
msgid "Color Picker"
msgstr "Pemungut Warna"

#: kiconedit.cpp:392
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Color Picker\n"
"\n"
"The color of the pixel clicked on will be the current draw color"
msgstr ""
"Pemungut Warna\n"
"\n"
"Warna piksel yang diklik akan menjadi warna lukis semasa"

#: kiconedit.cpp:397
#, kde-format
